  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Towards a mine-free Sri Lanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment was the first phase of the &apos;mine-free Sri Lanka program&apos;. The initiative supported the Government of Sri Lanka&apos;s ambition to achieve mine-free status to reduce the threat of death and injury for at-risk Sri Lankan populations. It also aimed to enable safe use of land for their livelihood development in Northern and Eastern Province in Sri Lanka.</narrative>
  </description>
